          <attvalue for="autonomy_description" value="1 – Orchestrated: execution decided by software workflow or human"/>
          <attvalue for="repo_comments" value="- implement a multispy for LSP (language server protocol) to autocomplete, find references, etc https://github.com/FSoft-AI4Code/HyperAgent/blob/c3092f2601ab3bf7f890fac2cd5b1290d3f59256/src/hyperagent/multilspy/language_server.py#L55&#xA;&#xA;- from langchain_community.document_loaders.parsers.language.code_segmenter import CodeSegmenter for &quot;    &quot;&quot;&quot;Parse using the respective programming language syntax.&#xA;&#xA;    Each top-level function and class in the code is loaded into separate documents.&#xA;    Furthermore, an extra document is generated, containing the remaining top-level code&#xA;    that excludes the already segmented functions and classes.&#xA;&#xA;    This approach can potentially improve the accuracy of QA models over source code.&quot; https://github.com/FSoft-AI4Code/HyperAgent/blob/c3092f2601ab3bf7f890fac2cd5b1290d3f59256/src/hyperagent/langchain_parsers/language/python.py#L6&#xA;- all agent setup in HyperAgent&#xA;- the arxiv url citation in README.md is wrong"/>
